IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-KNAPSACK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BUDGET-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CANDIDATE-PAGES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PHASE1-COST         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TOTAL-CONSUMED      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-KNAPSACK.
    IF BUDGET-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.
    IF CANDIDATE-PAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 80 TO PHASE1-COST.
    MOVE 1000 TO TOTAL-CONSUMED.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CANDIDATE-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 TOTAL-CONSUMED.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
